Hey, boss! Do you want me to kick out these sluggish idlers, so that you can replace them with some decent extra-angry fighters? No problem, will be done!

After I kick them, here's what we will have:

1. Officer: 2;

2. Officer: 1, Private: 1-3;

3. Officer: 1, Guard: 2-5.

I keep cleaning up their scraps, their brains and blood, and they just won't stop swarming!

What do you want, huh? Wanna taste my broom? Or you want me to hit the Defenders? They will get wild and will tear any your enemy apart! But I will take money for that, 'cause then I will have to hide from them instead of doing my job!

